  "description": "A standalone expression-driven assertion node for FluxFlow: an input in, a FlowAssertionResult broadcast out, with the original input fanned to Passed/Failed ports. No engine required.",
  "id": "FluxFlow.Components.Assertions",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-19T12:54:10.363Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
