  "packageSize": 36361,
  "published": "2026-06-19T12:50:54.53Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Rebuilt as a single standalone flow.assert node over a pre-compiled boolean expression: input in, assertion result broadcast out, original input fanned to the Passed/Failed ports, evaluation failures on the error port — all carrying the message correlation id. The engine factory, module, registration extensions, design-metadata provider, definition-options reader, and the engine/context-factory registry layer are removed; the node takes its options, an IFlowExpressionEngine, an optional IFlowMapContextFactory, and a TimeProvider directly and depends only on FluxFlow.Nodes and FluxFlow.Mapping (runs without the engine).",
